-- Details-panel content for the places that had none.
--
-- Generated by scripts/wine-map-sources/gen-place-profiles-migration.mjs from
-- data/wine-map/place-profiles.json. Do not hand-edit: the generator resolves every grape name and
-- canonical_key against the live catalog and refuses to emit anything if one of
-- them does not resolve. That check is the point of it. A grape name the
-- catalog does not carry does not raise on insert -- the join simply matches
-- nothing and the row vanishes, leaving a place quietly short of a variety.
--
-- 3 places: france 1, italy 1, portugal 1.
-- 16 style rows, 15 grape rows, 0 Bereich articles,
-- 0 varieties added to the grape catalog.
--
-- Convention follows the existing region rows (germany.mosel, italy.piemonte):
-- role PRINCIPAL, permitted true, share_pct null. Planting percentages are not
-- invented -- france.champagne carries them because they are published.
--
-- NO TILE RUN. scripts/wine-map-tiles/export.mjs reads wine_places and
-- wine_place_boundaries only; grapes, styles and articles are served by
-- get_wine_place_context at request time. Nothing here changes a tile.

begin;

